OL,3,GNEWSADog gatecrashes wedding as bride
OL,4,Aand groom watch on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA newly married couple have described
OL,7,Fthe "hilarious" moment when a runaway
OL,8,Fdog gatecrashed their wedding.
OL,10,FSimon and Amy Keane's wedding was about
OL,11,Fto begin on Saturday afternoon when a
OL,12,Fpassing Jack Russell sprinted into the
OL,13,Fchurch in Eastleigh, Hampshire.
OL,15,FIt then ran around members of the
OL,16,Fcongregation and joined the couple's
OL,17,Fown dog, Duggie, who was due to be a
OL,18,Fring bearer.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
